Z||000010||FieroMontreal||09-04-2001||04:11 PM||||Sheesh.. Why don't I ever find a deal like that? 2nd one I miss this summer...ugh.. lol. anyways,Jump on it! Sounds great! Like JSocha said, If you want power and you need an engine..why not just put a V8 in there.<P>If you ever need help with the GT send me an e-mail and eaither me or someone from the club will try to help you out. <P>If you end up NOT buying the car... please e-mail me the info so I can buy it  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> thanks! lol<P>We are having a "Corn Roast" on Sunday, Please feel free to come by! Member or not, even if you don't have your Fiero. For more info please e-mail me!<P>Thanks, Have fun, Enjoy the New GT<BR>-Alex<P>------------------<BR>-Alex<BR>President of Fiero Montreal<BR>86 GT **Silver Stallion**<BR>more soon<BR>fierogt@total.net <A HREF="http://www.fieromontreal.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieromontreal.com</A> ||||reg||1
